[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the steering wheel in\nthe centred position with the wheels straight.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely observe the safety regulations\nestablished for this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Clock spring coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428330\">D47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the stalk unit retaining band.</p><p>3. Move stalk unit (3a) slightly) by releasing tab (3b) from its\nretainer.</p><p>4. Open the cable band.</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connections (5a, 5b, 5c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5a</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428415\">H5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5b</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428416\">H5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5b</p></td><td><p>Steering column switch unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428417\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5c</p></td><td><p>Cruise Control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428418\">H7</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Recover the steering column switch unit.</p><p>If necessary, remove the clock spring, \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2429450\">5580C12</a>\n                                           for precautions to be observed.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045067.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the stalk unit \nis not damaged.</p><p>If removed, position the clock spring and\nbolt in place.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nstalk unit.</p><p>Position the wires correctly and secure\nwith bands.</p><p>Position the stalk unit and do up the tabs.</p><p>Tighten the retaining band.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nclock spring.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the devices are working properly.</p>"]]